      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>So I&#39;m playing against Voss with the Sentinels and Mr. Fixer on the team. Fixer has Dual Crowbars, GMF and Harmony out, so Writhe hits him with Black Out -- except he only got one follow-up shot, instead of having a second attack after each of the 2+ attacks. So what gives? Isn&#39;t he supposed to do one after each? Is this a bug?</p><p>EDIT: Okay, same game, and Sky-Scraper played Catch a Ride on Mr. Fixer -- the first blow from the Crowbars killed a minion, while the second hit the transporter, which survived, but Sky-Scraper&#39;s blow never came. I thought previous rulings said that you could pick one of the two to hit, but this didn&#39;t even give the option?</p>",
